  "Q00021_HiddenTruth/31350-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00021_HiddenTruth/31350-02.html",
   "quest": 21,
   "text": "Dominic: Maybe he was the guy who long ago was expelled for keeping a devil worshipper with him! He's probably a beggar now. I don't waste my time with such filth.",
