  "Q00021_HiddenTruth/31350-01.html": {
   "file": "Q00021_HiddenTruth/31350-01.html",
   "quest": 21,
   "text": "Priest Dominic: Is Innocentin one of those devil worshippers executed in the old witch trials? I never heard of him, ask someone else.",
